WEBVTT

00:00:00.351 --> 00:00:09.871
Give this project its own Claude model and effort. Return the harness to the Antigravity default. When you switch back to Claude, Haiku and low effort are still there.

00:00:16.227 --> 00:00:26.267
Antigravity is the usual harness for this task. Switch to Claude Code for this start and the model picker marks the project’s configured Claude model, Haiku, as Default.

00:00:27.221 --> 00:00:37.501
In the Review tab, choose a finding to fix and open Submit to new agent. The picker starts from the review setting, Fable, even though the task’s worker uses Antigravity.
